  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "A01",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "秦始皇陵的兵马俑都挖出来几十年了，可真正的地宫——秦始皇安葬的地方，到今天也没打开。",
      "chars": 42,
      "speech_ms": 8500,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 8500,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A02",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "为什么？",
      "chars": 4,
      "speech_ms": 470,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 8900,
      "end_ms": 9370,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A03",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "不是挖不动。",
      "chars": 6,
      "speech_ms": 860,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 9770,
      "end_ms": 10630,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A04",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "头一个原因，是怕护不住。",
      "chars": 12,
      "speech_ms": 2320,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 11030,
      "end_ms": 13350,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A05",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "兵马俑刚出土时，身上的颜色见了空气没多久就脱落了，这个教训太深：地宫里若有竹简、漆器，一打开，可能就来不及护。",
      "chars": 55,
      "speech_ms": 11890,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 13750,
      "end_ms": 25640,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A06",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "第二个原因，史书里写过，地宫里以水银做江河湖海；后来的探测也确实发现，封土一带有汞含量异常的地方，和记载能对上几分——但地宫里到底是什么样，凭这个还下不了结论。",
      "chars": 80,
      "speech_ms": 19230,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 26040,
      "end_ms": 45270,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A07",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "在保护的把握没备足之前，专家宁可让它在地下再等些年。",
      "chars": 26,
      "speech_ms": 5330,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 45670,
      "end_ms": 51000,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A08",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "开挖是本事，忍住不开，是更大的本事。",
      "chars": 18,
      "speech_ms": 3890,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 51400,
      "end_ms": 55290,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A09",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "这份克制，是留给后人的。",
      "chars": 12,
      "speech_ms": 2310,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 55690,
      "end_ms": 58000,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    }
  ]
}